        "content": "Kahuta is located at less than 150 KM from some of the forward bases of the IAF, which would be well within the reach of MiG21/23 and freshly inducted Jaguar aircraft. While it was physically within reach, it\u00e2\u0080\u0099s the strategic consideration that weighed heavily against the attack.\n\nAn attack on Kahuta promised a tactical setback for Pakistan, but a retaliatory strike on Trombay threatened a radiological disaster for Mumbai\u00e2\u0080\u0094a price India chose not to pay.\n\n\u00e2\u0081\u00a0It\u00e2\u0080\u0099s difficult to say what India could have achieved by attacking this facility. It was recovering from the 1971 Ops and on path to development. In my considered opinion the restraint exercised by the government paid India much greater dividends, which could be encashed at a later date through the image of a responsible nation, than the attack would have.\n\nRussia\n\nUSA\n\nUSA\n\nRussia\n\nFrance\n\nIndia\n\nN. Korea\n\nRussia\n\nChina\n\nIndia\n\nIndia\n\nIndia\n\nIndia\n\nIndia\n\nIndia\n\nIndia\n\nIndia\n\nIndia\n\nIndia\n\nIsrael\n\nIsrael\n\nIsrael\n\nIsrael\n\nIsrael\n\nIsrael\n\nIsrael\n\nIsrael\n\nIsrael\n\nIsrael\n\nIsrael\n\nUSA\n\nUSA\n\nUSA\n\nUSA\n\nUSA\n\nUSA\n\nUSA\n\nUSA\n\nIran\n\nIran\n\nIran\n\nIran\n\nIran\n\nIran\n\nIran\n\nIran\n\nIran\n\nIran\n\nIran\n\nIran\n\nRussia"
