  "markdown_content": "## Incident Details\\n\\nKahuta is located at less than 150 KM from some of the forward bases of the IAF, which would be well within the reach of MiG21/23 and freshly inducted Jaguar aircraft. While it was physically within reach, it\u2019s the strategic consideration that weighed heavily against the attack.\\n\\nAn attack on Kahuta promised a tactical setback for Pakistan, but a retaliatory strike on Trombay threatened a radiological disaster for Mumbai\u2014a price India chose not to pay.\\n\\n## Strategic Considerations\\n\\nIt\u2019s difficult to say what India could have achieved by attacking this facility. It was recovering from the 1971 Ops and on path to development.\\n\\n> In my considered opinion the restraint exercised by the government paid India much greater dividends, which could be encashed at a later date through the image of a responsible nation, than the attack would have.\\n\\n## Countries Mentioned\\n\\n- Russia\\n- USA\\n- USA\\n- Russia\\n- France\\n- India\\n- N. Korea\\n- Russia\\n- China\\n- India\\n- India\\n- India\\n- India\\n- India\\n- India\\n- India\\n- India\\n- India\\n- India\\n- Israel\\n- Israel\\n- Israel\\n- Israel\\n- Israel\\n- Israel\\n- Israel\\n- Israel\\n- Israel\\n- Israel\\n- Israel\\n- USA\\n- USA\\n- USA\\n- USA\\n- USA\\n- USA\\n- USA\\n- USA\\n- Iran\\n- Iran\\n- Iran\\n- Iran\\n- Iran\\n- Iran\\n- Iran\\n- Iran\\n- Iran\\n- Iran\\n- Iran\\n- Iran\\n- Russia",
